{"id":"585b074277aea3ae","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-program-transfinite-stages.md","title":"程序envelope的超限阶段","display":"df-program-transfinite-stages — 程序envelope的超限阶段","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-program-transfinite-stages","aliases":["72-df-program-transfinite-stages"],"display":"df-program-transfinite-stages — 程序envelope的超限阶段","depends_on":["[[72-df-program-envelope]]","[[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]","[[72-df-finite-envelope-iteration]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX Definition3.3.1, print653/PDF665; source page image checked","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local well-definedness argument recorded","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-program-transfinite-stages"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-program-transfinite-stages</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-program-transfinite-stages — 程序envelope的超限阶段"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c4d010edfaaea6b\" href=\"?note=6c4d010edfaaea6b\" title=\"72-df-program-envelope\">72-df-program-envelope</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d95b8963194821b\" href=\"?note=5d95b8963194821b\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration\">72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7fdc7a7a93d79109\" href=\"?note=7fdc7a7a93d79109\" title=\"72-df-finite-envelope-iteration\">72-df-finite-envelope-iteration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX Definition3.3.1, print653/PDF665; source page image checked"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local well-definedness argument recorded"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c4d010edfaaea6b\" href=\"?note=6c4d010edfaaea6b\" title=\"72-df-program-envelope\">72-df-program-envelope</a> 的有限程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>、非空基底 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 及函数、常元解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K:=K_\\Sigma(D)\">\\(K:=K_\\Sigma(D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_P\">\\(\\mathcal E_P\\)</span> 均使用同一基底。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq\\subseteq K^2\">\\(\\sqsubseteq\\subseteq K^2\\)</span> 是逐坐标信息序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 为序数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J^\\theta_{K,\\sqsubseteq,U,\\mathcal E_P}\">\\(J^\\theta_{K,\\sqsubseteq,U,\\mathcal E_P}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d95b8963194821b\" href=\"?note=5d95b8963194821b\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration\">72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_P^n\">\\(J_P^n\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7fdc7a7a93d79109\" href=\"?note=7fdc7a7a93d79109\" title=\"72-df-finite-envelope-iteration\">72-df-finite-envelope-iteration</a> 的有限阶段，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PCPO}(K,\\sqsubseteq,U)\\land\n\\forall M,N\\in K\\ (M\\sqsubseteq N\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal E_P(N)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PCPO}(K,\\sqsubseteq,U)\\land\n\\forall M,N\\in K\\ (M\\sqsubseteq N\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal E_P(N)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}:=J^\\theta_{K,\\sqsubseteq,U,\\mathcal E_P}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}:=J^\\theta_{K,\\sqsubseteq,U,\\mathcal E_P}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(0)&amp;=U,\\\\\n\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(\\alpha+1)&amp;=\\mathcal E_P(\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(\\alpha))\\quad(\\alpha&lt;\\theta),\\\\\nR^{\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(\\lambda)}(\\vec d)&amp;=\\bigsqcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}R^{\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(\\alpha)}(\\vec d)\\quad(0&lt;\\lambda\\le\\theta,\\ \\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)),\\\\\nn\\le\\theta&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(n)=J_P^n.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(0)&amp;=U,\\\\\n\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(\\alpha+1)&amp;=\\mathcal E_P(\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(\\alpha))\\quad(\\alpha&lt;\\theta),\\\\\nR^{\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(\\lambda)}(\\vec d)&amp;=\\bigsqcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}R^{\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(\\alpha)}(\\vec d)\\quad(0&lt;\\lambda\\le\\theta,\\ \\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)),\\\\\nn\\le\\theta&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(n)=J_P^n.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定基底的四值结构空间是逐坐标完全格，底为全未知结构；envelope单调，满足一般超限迭代接口。限制到有限指标时，两套递归具有同一初始值和后继算子，故逐 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 相等。源书用类阶段记法；这里对每个给定序数界给集合函数，并由限制相容性接续，不在集合量词里放“所有序数的结构族”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-program-envelope","status":"resolved","id":"6c4d010edfaaea6b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-program-envelope]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"5d95b8963194821b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-envelope-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"7fdc7a7a93d79109","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-envelope-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-program-envelope","status":"resolved","id":"6c4d010edfaaea6b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-program-envelope]] 的有限程序 $P$、非空基底 $D$ 及函数、常元解释；$K:=K_\\Sigma(D)$、$U$、$\\mathcal E_P$ 均使用同一基底。$\\sqsubseteq\\subseteq K^2$ 是逐坐标信息序。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"5d95b8963194821b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta$ 为序数；$J^\\theta_{K,\\sqsubseteq,U,\\mathcal E_P}$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]。$J_P^n$ 是 [[72-df-finite-envelope-iteration]] 的有限阶段，$n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-envelope-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"7fdc7a7a93d79109","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta$ 为序数；$J^\\theta_{K,\\sqsubseteq,U,\\mathcal E_P}$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]。$J_P^n$ 是 [[72-df-finite-envelope-iteration]] 的有限阶段，$n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"K:=K_\\Sigma(D)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqsubseteq\\subseteq K^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"J^\\theta_{K,\\sqsubseteq,U,\\mathcal E_P}","display":false},{"tex":"J_P^n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PCPO}(K,\\sqsubseteq,U)\\land\n\\forall M,N\\in K\\ (M\\sqsubseteq N\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal E_P(M)\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal E_P(N)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}:=J^\\theta_{K,\\sqsubseteq,U,\\mathcal E_P}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(0)&=U,\\\\\n\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(\\alpha+1)&=\\mathcal E_P(\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(\\alpha))\\quad(\\alpha<\\theta),\\\\\nR^{\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(\\lambda)}(\\vec d)&=\\bigsqcup_{\\alpha<\\lambda}R^{\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(\\alpha)}(\\vec d)\\quad(0<\\lambda\\le\\theta,\\ \\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)),\\\\\nn\\le\\theta&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}(n)=J_P^n.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":2297,"backlinks":[{"id":"340d363b06fe8470","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定互异非逻辑符号 $0,f,R,S$，变量 $u=v_0,v=v_1$。项编码及程序、四值结构、信息序使用 [[72-df-program-transfinite-stages]] 的本册接口。签名、Herbrand域、函数解释和程序 $P$ 在下式构造。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-420","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-program-transfinite-stages|df-program-transfinite-stages — 程序envelope的超限阶段]]"},{"id":"64b08328ac145622","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P,K,U,\\mathcal E_P,I_P$ 与 $\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}$ 取 [[72-df-program-transfinite-stages]]；$\\theta:=\\mathfrak h(K)$，$J:=\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}$。"}],"outgoing":["6c4d010edfaaea6b","5d95b8963194821b","7fdc7a7a93d79109"]}